  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EERC Magisterutb</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EERC Masters prog - Support of EERC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens syfte &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja ett tv&#xe5;-&#xe5;rigt Mastersprogram i ekonomi, genomf&#xf6;rt av Economics Education and Research Consortium (EERC) i Ukraina, f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja en moderniseringsprocess i ekonomisk utbildning och forskning. Att utbilda n&#xe4;sta generations ekonomer i Ukraina st&#xf6;djer det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let EU-integration genom att fr&#xe4;mja ekonomisk transition.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to support a two-year Masters program in economics, carried out by the Economics Education and Research Consortium (EERC) in Ukraine, to further the modernization of economic education and research. Training a new generation of economists in Ukraine is intended to further an overall goal of EU integration by supporting economic transition.</narrative>
  </description>
